    "detailed_description": "Zombies are closing in, and there's no more time to hesitate!<br><br>Zombie Hunter: D-Day is a first-person shooter where you fight to survive the zombie apocalypse.<br><br>Use all the weapons in your arsenal to clear each new stage of zombies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300a STORY \u300b</strong></h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/d0ab30aa526fce0f6265b00ccd37c1ce.poster.avif?t=1690420294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/d0ab30aa526fce0f6265b00ccd37c1ce.webm?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/d0ab30aa526fce0f6265b00ccd37c1ce.mp4?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The zombie apocalypse comes out of nowhere.<br>The city, once brimming with life, is now a place of death,<br>filled with a thick fog and horrible shrieks.<br><br>You find yourself in cramped spaces, teeming with the undead.<br>Defend against the waves of zombies as your fight for survival begins!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300a GAMEPLAY \u300b</strong></h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/69a52b059ea11a3b5f290304b4b971b3.poster.avif?t=1690420294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/69a52b059ea11a3b5f290304b4b971b3.webm?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/69a52b059ea11a3b5f290304b4b971b3.mp4?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/ae757ae18b970ea11aa579fa84d80b87.poster.avif?t=1690420294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/ae757ae18b970ea11aa579fa84d80b87.webm?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/ae757ae18b970ea11aa579fa84d80b87.mp4?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flocks of fearless zombies</strong></h2>Use an arsenal of firearms to obliterate the ravenous undead!<br><br>If you do survive, you've only got a moment to breathe.<br>The next group of zombies is already swarming in!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fend off the attacking waves</strong></h2>Over time, zombies become more powerful<br>as they continue to pour in!<br>Prepare for the running, crawling, ambushing horde!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An arsenal of weapons and upgrade options</strong></h2>With shotguns, rifles, machine guns, and more,<br><br>you're fully equipped with firearms for any situation!<br>Upgrade your equipment to become even more powerful!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various game modes to enjoy</strong></h2>From your basic walkers to menacing zombie giants,<br>all sorts of trials await!<br>See how long you can last in Zombie Defense,<br>test out weapons in Weapons Experience, and more with<br>all the different game modes to enjoy!<br><br>\u00a92023 CLE Games All Rights Reserved. Published by CFK.",
    "about_the_game": "Zombies are closing in, and there's no more time to hesitate!<br><br>Zombie Hunter: D-Day is a first-person shooter where you fight to survive the zombie apocalypse.<br><br>Use all the weapons in your arsenal to clear each new stage of zombies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300a STORY \u300b</strong></h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/d0ab30aa526fce0f6265b00ccd37c1ce.poster.avif?t=1690420294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/d0ab30aa526fce0f6265b00ccd37c1ce.webm?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/d0ab30aa526fce0f6265b00ccd37c1ce.mp4?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The zombie apocalypse comes out of nowhere.<br>The city, once brimming with life, is now a place of death,<br>filled with a thick fog and horrible shrieks.<br><br>You find yourself in cramped spaces, teeming with the undead.<br>Defend against the waves of zombies as your fight for survival begins!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300a GAMEPLAY \u300b</strong></h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/69a52b059ea11a3b5f290304b4b971b3.poster.avif?t=1690420294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/69a52b059ea11a3b5f290304b4b971b3.webm?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/69a52b059ea11a3b5f290304b4b971b3.mp4?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/ae757ae18b970ea11aa579fa84d80b87.poster.avif?t=1690420294\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/ae757ae18b970ea11aa579fa84d80b87.webm?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413730/extras/ae757ae18b970ea11aa579fa84d80b87.mp4?t=1690420294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flocks of fearless zombies</strong></h2>Use an arsenal of firearms to obliterate the ravenous undead!<br><br>If you do survive, you've only got a moment to breathe.<br>The next group of zombies is already swarming in!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fend off the attacking waves</strong></h2>Over time, zombies become more powerful<br>as they continue to pour in!<br>Prepare for the running, crawling, ambushing horde!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An arsenal of weapons and upgrade options</strong></h2>With shotguns, rifles, machine guns, and more,<br><br>you're fully equipped with firearms for any situation!<br>Upgrade your equipment to become even more powerful!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various game modes to enjoy</strong></h2>From your basic walkers to menacing zombie giants,<br>all sorts of trials await!<br>See how long you can last in Zombie Defense,<br>test out weapons in Weapons Experience, and more with<br>all the different game modes to enjoy!<br><br>\u00a92023 CLE Games All Rights Reserved. Published by CFK.",
